<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 23.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 23.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 July 23		July 22</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.942		  4.918</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  24.028		 23.598</p>
<p>Cash balance		  28.970		 28.516</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,282.324	     5,280.663</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $2 million were issued and $14 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
